Now let me write the RED tests. I'll append two new suites to test_findingRegistry.js:

1. `suite('marker-safe payload — --> in reviewer text cannot corrupt the marker (rework gh-1343)')`
2. `suite('normalizePrCommentList — the shared comment-shape ladder')`
